          "published_at": "2025-07-18",
          "title_zh": "生态环境部披露京津冀生态协同治理进展",
          "title_en": "MEE reports progress in coordinated ecological governance across Beijing, Tianjin and Hebei",
          "summary_zh": "2024年京津冀细颗粒物年均浓度为36.8微克每立方米，比2014年下降58.7%；三地累计压减钢铁产能超过1亿吨，并形成跨省流域生态补偿和重污染天气联动机制。",
          "summary_en": "Average PM2.5 in the region fell to 36.8 micrograms per cubic metre in 2024, 58.7% below 2014, alongside steel-capacity cuts, cross-provincial ecological compensation and joint pollution-response mechanisms.",
          "source_zh": "生态环境部",
          "source_en": "Ministry of Ecology and Environment",
          "url": "https://www.mee.gov.cn/xxgk2018/xxgk/xxgk13/202511/t20251120_1134447_wh.html",
