          "id": "bth-2025-forum",
          "published_at": "2025-09-11",
          "title_zh": "京津冀发布清洁空气与低碳转型阶段性数据",
          "title_en": "Beijing, Tianjin and Hebei present new evidence on clean air and low-carbon transition",
          "summary_zh": "北京优质能源占比达到99.5%，天津建成零碳港区，河北累计压减退出炼钢产能1.1亿吨；三地2024年细颗粒物年均浓度较2013年均下降超过六成。",
          "summary_en": "Beijing reported a 99.5% share of high-quality energy, Tianjin a zero-carbon port area, and Hebei 110 million tonnes of retired steelmaking capacity; PM2.5 fell by more than 60% across all three jurisdictions from 2013 to 2024.",
