          "published_at": "2025-02-24",
          "title_zh": "生态环境部部署京津冀大气污染治理强化措施",
          "title_en": "MEE plans stronger air-pollution measures for Beijing, Tianjin, Hebei and surrounding areas",
          "summary_zh": "2024年京津冀及周边地区细颗粒物平均浓度较2017年下降33.8%，但13个城市仍处于全国后20位；下一阶段将聚焦产业、能源和交通结构调整及区域联防联控。",
          "summary_en": "Regional PM2.5 fell 33.8% from 2017 to 2024, although 13 cities remained among the national bottom 20; the next phase targets industrial, energy and transport restructuring and coordinated controls.",
