          "title_zh": "京津冀生态协同机制与绿色转型成效发布",
          "title_en": "Beijing, Tianjin and Hebei publish results from coordinated ecological governance",
          "summary_zh": "三地已建立空气、水环境、执法与统一标准等协作机制，并共同实施区域低碳出行碳普惠核算标准；天津港清洁能源机械占比超过70%，河北55家在产钢铁企业全部达到A级环保绩效。",
          "summary_en": "The region has built joint mechanisms for air, water, enforcement and standards, and adopted a common low-carbon travel accounting standard; clean-energy machinery exceeds 70% at Tianjin Port and all 55 operating Hebei steelmakers achieved top-tier environmental performance.",
